          "text": "6 tips before becoming a hybrid athlete"
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 2,
          "slide_label": "Slide 2",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "save this. you'll need it at the gym"
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 3,
          "slide_label": "Slide 3",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "1- don't grind all week thinking that's what speeds up your progress."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 4,
          "slide_label": "Slide 4",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "2- the secret to consistency is easing off the intensity. take it slow."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 5,
          "slide_label": "Slide 5",
          "is_metafi_slide": true,
          "text": "also. get a lifting plan that adjusts around your sport\ntry the app"
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 6,
          "slide_label": "Slide 6",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "4- get in the habit of sprinting twice a week. single best thing for spiking your testosterone."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 7,
          "slide_label": "Slide 7",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "5- finished a lifting session? hit the cold plunge. you'll come out fresh and ready for the rest of your week."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 8,
          "slide_label": "Slide 8",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "6- pick one sport alongside lifting. don't overload yourself."
        }
